Fixes:
- Count time on a clock of 30 frames a second, the rate it was made for, so a 60 fps project plays it at the same speed.
- Keep a lone quote, size the line-number gutter to the line count, shrink the code to fit the window down to a readable minimum, and scroll to keep the newest line in view.

